title: The Death of Hermann Müller
view-if: year = 1931 and month >= 3
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
tags: event
on-arrival: muller_dead = 1; n_advisors -= 1 if muller_advisor == 1; muller_advisor = 0; muller_died_in_office = 1 if chancellor = "Müller"; succession_active = 1

Herman Müller, one of the SPD's long-time leaders, has died. He will be greatly missed.

- @muller_advisor_succession: We must decide his successor as advisor.
- @muller_chancellor_succession: We must decide his successor as Chancellor.
- @muller_chancellor_succession_bruning: We will allow Heinrich Brüning (Z) to succeed as Chancellor.
- @muller_chancellor_succession_wirth: We will allow Joseph Wirth (Z) to succeed as Chancellor.
- @muller_coleader_1_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @muller_coleader_2_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @muller_coleader_3_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @succession_concluded: We have dealt with all matters of succession.

@muller_advisor_succession
view-if: muller_advisor == 1
on-arrival: muller_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed muller as an advisor?

@muller_chancellor_succession
view-if: chancellor == "Müller"
go-to: election_1928.spd_chancellor_menu

Who should succeed muller as Chancellor?

@muller_coleader_1_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_1 == "Müller"

Who should succeed muller as Co-leader?

- @vogel1: Hans Vogel is the clear choice.

@muller_coleader_2_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_2 == "Müller" 

Who should succeed muller as Co-leader?

- @vogel2: Hans Vogel is the clear choice.

@muller_coleader_3_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_3 == "Müller" 

Who should succeed muller as Co-leader?

- @vogel3: Hans Vogel is the clear choice.

@vogel1
on-arrival: spd_coleader_1 = "Vogel" 

@vogel2
on-arrival: spd_coleader_2 = "Vogel" 

@vogel3
on-arrival: spd_coleader_3 = "Vogel" 

@muller_chancellor_succession_bruning
on-arrival: chancellor = "Brüning"; chancellor_party = "Z"; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5
subtitle: The Center Party claims it is their turn...

The Center Party is grateful that we have supported Brüning for Chancellor.

@muller_chancellor_succession_wirth
on-arrival: chancellor = "Wirth"; chancellor_party = "Z"; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 2
view-if: z_party_leader = "Joos"
subtitle: As a moderate member of the Center Party, he could represent unity.

Our coalition partners accept Joseph Wirth of the Center Party as the new Chancellor.

@succession_concluded
on-arrival: succession_active = 0
go-to: root

